1
00:00:00,998 --> 00:00:03,538
I'm hungry again!

2
00:00:05,902 --> 00:00:08,742
(Howard:)It's like the world's
fattest cuckoo clock.

3
00:00:12,909 --> 00:00:15,249
(Bernadette:)You know, you're always talking
about having a baby someday.

4
00:00:15,412 --> 00:00:18,582
-This is exactly what it'll be like.
-No, it's not.

5
00:00:18,749 --> 00:00:23,259
(Bernadette:)Come on. The constant fussing,
eating, pooping, burping, drooling.

6
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:26,560
(Bernadette:)We're even waiting for the day
when she can finally walk on her own.

7
00:00:28,091 --> 00:00:28,931
(Howard:)Maybe you're right.

8
00:00:29,026 --> 00:00:32,166
(Howard:)Anything she finds on the floor
goes right in her mouth.

9
00:00:37,534 --> 00:00:39,534
(Bernadette:)I'm just telling you now,
if we do have kids,

10
00:00:39,703 --> 00:00:42,043
(Bernadette:)don't expect me to do all the work.

11
00:00:42,205 --> 00:00:45,185
(Howard:)Hey, I'm a very paternal person.

12
00:00:45,342 --> 00:00:48,012
(Howard:)I'd be excellent
at taking care of a baby.

13
00:00:48,845 --> 00:00:50,625
l'm still hungry!

14
00:00:50,781 --> 00:00:58,021
I'm coming, you big baby!

